  "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
  "instance_name": "mapping_1",
  "label": "The 9/11 attacks are mapped onto the political choice being questioned",
  "description": "The top text 'we said we would never forget' is mapped onto the visual entity 'World_Trade_Center_towers', which symbolizes the 9/11 attacks. The rhetorical question 'why are you voting them into our government?' implies that the political figures being criticized are associated with the attackers, thus mapping the trauma of 9/11 onto the act of voting for such figures. This creates an analogical mapping where the visual symbol of the towers (representing the attack) is equated with the political decision being condemned.",
